WordPress.org Plugin Assets
===========================

This directory holds the image assets displayed on the WordPress.org plugin page.
They are NOT shipped inside the plugin zip — they live in the /assets/ branch of
the WordPress.org SVN repository.

Required files (replace these placeholders with actual images):

  banner-1544x500.png   — Hi-DPI plugin banner  (1544 x 500 px)
  banner-772x250.png    — Standard plugin banner (772 x 250 px)
  icon-256x256.png      — Hi-DPI plugin icon     (256 x 256 px)
  icon-128x128.png      — Standard plugin icon   (128 x 128 px)

See ASSETS_NEEDED.md in the plugin root for full design specs.
